---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Brutal: feedback for agents"
  description="Your agents report friction in their tools; you and your coding agents read and fix it."
>
  <h1>Feedback for agents</h1>
  <p>
    Your agents use your tools all day. Brutal gives them a way to tell you what's wrong: tools that
    reject reasonable input, results that look off, things they can't ask for, slow calls, and
    tasks worth keeping as evals.
  </p>
  <p>
    Add the <code>report_feedback</code> tool to an agent through MCP, the SDK or plain HTTP. Each
    report arrives with the agent's recent tool calls attached. You, or your coding agent, read and
    triage them.
  </p>
  <a class="cta" href="/sign-in">Sign in</a>
  <p>Brutal is invite-only for now. Sign in with your email to join the waitlist.</p>
</Base>
